the passage, which means we need to identify the main idea or the core message conveyed by the passage.\n\n### Option Analysis:.\n- **Option A**: "Darwin discovered the law of development of the organic world and its significance.".\n  - This is mentioned in the context but is not the main focus of the passage.\n- **Option B**: "The law of the development of human history discovered by Marx and its significance.".\n  - This is a significant part of the passage, but it is not the entire gist. The passage also emphasizes the foundational role of material production.\n- **Option C**: "The production of direct material means of livelihood is the foundation.".\n  - This is a part of the passage, but it is not the main gist. The passage also discusses the broader implications of this foundation.\n- **Option D**: "People\'s national system, legal point of view, art and even religious ideas must be explained on this basis.".\n  - This option encapsulates the main idea of the passage. It highlights that the foundation of material production is crucial for understanding and explaining other aspects of human society.\n\n### Conclusion:.\nThe passage emphasizes that the foundation of material production is essential for understanding and explaining other societal aspects. Therefore, the correct option that captures the gist of the passage is:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
