rrect.\n\n### Conclusion:.\nThe incorrect statement is **Option C: There must be other criterion to test the truth.** This statement is not necessarily incorrect, but it is not supported by the given context.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
