messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe cultural industry integrates intensive talent, technology, knowledge and capital, and has distinct cross-disciplinary, cross-disciplinary, cross-time-space and cross-cultural characteristics. It will also play a central role in future personal behavior, social life and nation-building, as well as global development and human affairs. Report of the World Commission on Culture and Development of the United Nations Scientific, Educational and Cultural Organization in 1995. It is pointed out that culture is the ultimate goal and destination of the overall prosperity and development of human existence. It can be said that the cross-border characteristics and importance of culture put forward fundamental requirements for the high quality and scale of cultural talents.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is the main content of this text?\n# Options:\nA) Cultural industry plays an important role in human social life\nB) Cultural talents should have high quality and scale\nC) Culture is the ultimate goal of human prosperity and development\nD) The particularity and importance of cultural industry. I think the correct option is: D\n', 'To determine the main content of the text, let\'s break down the context and analyze each option step by step.\n\n### Context Analysis:.\n1. **Integration of Resources**: The cultural industry involves various resources like talent, technology, knowledge, and capital.\n2. **Characteristics**: It has cross-disciplinary, cross-time-space, and cross-cultural characteristics.\n3. **Role in Future**: It will play a central role in future personal behavior, social life, nation-building, global development, and human affairs.\n4. **Importance of Culture**: Culture is the ultimate goal and destination of overall human prosperity and development.\n5. **Requirement for Cultural Talents**: The cross-border characteristics and importance of culture necessitate high-quality and scale cultural talents.\n\n### Option Analysis:.\n- **A) Cultural industry plays an important role in human social life**:.\n  - This is mentioned in the context but is not the main focus. It is a supporting point.\n\n- **B) Cultural talents should have high quality and scale**:.\n  - This is directly stated in the context: "It is pointed out that culture is the ultimate goal and destination of the overall prosperity and development of human existence. It can be said that the cross-border characteristics and importance of culture put forward fundamental requirements for the high quality and scale of cultural talents.".\n\n- **C) Culture is the ultimate goal of human prosperity and development**:.\n  - This is also mentioned in the context but is not the main focus. It is a supporting point.\n\n- **D) The particularity and importance of cultural industry**:.\n  - This is mentioned in the context but is not the main focus. It is a supporting point.\n\n### Conclusion:.\nThe main content of the text is the requirement for high-quality and scale cultural talents due to the cross-border characteristics and importance of culture.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
